g/zh/cultivation/%E6%88%91%E6%98%AF%E6%80%8E%E6%A0%B7%E6%94%B9%E5%8F%98%E6%AF%8D%E4%BA%B2%E7%9A%84/</guid><description>乍看主题，好像是谈怎样使母亲改变来顺应我，其实不然。 为什么要谈这个话题？融洽母女亲情关系，说简单也不简单。母女双方都会怀着“为你好”的主观意</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%88%91%e6%98%af%e6%80%8e%e6%a0%b7%e6%94%b9%e5%8f%98%e6%af%8d%e4%ba%b2%e7%9a%84.assets/640.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>家人</category><category>爱人</category><category>执着</category><category>修心</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>家人爱人</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%AE%B6%E4%BA%BA%E7%88%B1%E4%BA%BA/</link><pubDate>Tue, 20 Nov 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Tue, 20 Nov 2018 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%AE%B6%E4%BA%BA%E7%88%B1%E4%BA%BA/</guid><description>虽说生老病死是我们每个人不得不面对的一个问题，但这个世界好不容易来一次，我们有太多的事情要做，有太多的梦想需要完成，这些事情这些梦想都是延续</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%ae%b6%e4%ba%ba%e7%88%b1%e4%ba%ba.assets/image-20230110220255094.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>家人</category><category>爱人</category><category>执着</category><category>修心</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item></channel></rss>